        "description": "Exclusion of secondary causes such as vascular, metabolic, or structural lesions",
        "category": "major",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": true
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of progressive freezing of gait with absence of classical parkinsonism and exclusion of secondary causes",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is clinical and requires exclusion of other neurodegenerative and secondary causes."
